uto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=04f8b1ea0e380634d005f6a04a272682 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f27002ae/uploads/origins/8a6ff816-880d-4a46-a405-a009e9a2e0e3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5b2b85a6f57bdb28b51875b5de0ca836 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Good evening! I love your art, the way you draw eyes is amazing! I would like to request a piece for my vtuber character. My character is a devious imp, the kind that likes to give people bad ideas for fun. If it's alright, I would like to leave the pose up to you! My character reference can be found at the link below.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/ThanatosVT/status/1442568473134067715?s=20&t=ODqfmwiNv", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@___beubeu/works/29", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/74fe758d/uploads/origins/725cfa2e-ccf8-4244-9be3-dc21752fcd95?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1081b6510b3b80d5ae1b7cd065bacdf6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/74fe758d/uploads/origins/725cfa2e-ccf8-4244-9be3-dc21752fcd95?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1081b6510b3b80d5ae1b7cd065bacdf6, https://si.imgix.net/74fe758d/uploads/origins/725cfa2e-ccf8-4244-9be3-dc21752fcd95?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=71cc08a5764b61041abe7ad8a17d5e98 2x, https://si.imgix.net/74fe758d/uploads/origins/725cfa2e-ccf8-4244-9be3-dc21752fcd95?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1500cda3942486950094ff7b7c03f4ef 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！『僕のヒーローアカデミア』のツユアスイのヒーロー服を着たニーコを見てみたいです。\n\n詳しくは、ツユはカエルをモチーフにしたヒーローで、カエルのスーパーパワーを持つので、ネエコは舌を出すなど、カエルらしい行動をすることができるかもしれません。また、池の真ん中にある大きなユリノキの上にしゃがんでいるかもしれません。\n\nその他、アレンジは自由です。\n\nありがとうございました。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1bnl-YZwkCAqwr7MK2Xh25DZQGfVR8RXt", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path"